        <div class="recalc-card">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <h3 class="smaller-heading">Assigned delivery route R-204</h3>
            <span class="status-badge status-good">
              <span class="status-dot"></span>
              good on schedule
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="sub-quiet">Assigned vehicle <span class="font-mono">VAN-27</span> (plate <span class="font-mono">MTR-482</span>) · Driver Tariq Mansour</p>
          <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
            <span class="metric-label">Departure &amp; stop qualification</span>
            <div class="font-mono" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 2px;">
              Planned departure 14 May 15:00 BST · Cedar Clinic stop
